;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\和ぴあの２.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山廃屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山廃屋中.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>All three of us sat still, without a word.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Obasan</STYLE> won't want to talk about <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>, and <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> doesn't seem to know that much either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before that, the two of them spent the whole day searching for <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, so they must be exhausted too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
So much happened in this one day.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\体育館.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "12" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Thank you very much for holding such a grand entrance ceremony today for us, the Shiyo 800 new students of Motoki Prefectural High School. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">To the principal, to all the teachers, and to our honored guests, I offer my heartfelt thanks.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">Here in Motoki-cho, famous for its cherry blossoms, the petals are dancing everywhere today as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">The scenery surrounding us seemed almost to shine, and on the way to this hall, walking with my mother, each time I found cherry blossoms or other spring flowers, I felt as though every one of them was celebrating us new students.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">Having received such warm words from the principal, our honored guests, and the upper-year students, I am truly deeply moved.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Until now, I have followed the rails my parents laid for me without a single question.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">However, upon entering this school and receiving words from all of you, I have come to wish, without fail, to gain independence and learning at this school and to find what I myself want to become in the future.</STYLE><PG>
It was this morning that I heard <STYLE ID="5">Goto's</STYLE> speech at the entrance ceremony.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For <STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE>, it was an utterly ordinary speech, with no attempt to stand out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She'd have wanted to speak more in her own words, I'm sure, but with <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> case she couldn't spare the attention.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "12" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"It's okay. Trust my intuition."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I know, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> won't be a child forever."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I left the house with <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE> watching me worriedly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\電車ボックス席.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "12" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you don't want any more lunch?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"If I eat too much, the blood won't reach my brain."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Don't go saying you're hungry later, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Three servings of lunch ended up in our three stomachs in roughly equal shares.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\弁当.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The entrance ceremony feels like ages ago now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A case heavier and more mysterious than I'd imagined.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
More than a case, 'phenomenon' is the better word now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The breeding of an unknown fungus―I can understand that that's the cause.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I understand cause and effect, but the process is far too complex to grasp.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If even <STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE> hasn't found the answer yet, there's no way someone like me...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山廃屋中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>, sitting, is nodding off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The night has grown quite late.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you're tired, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　I'll keep watch, so why don't you rest a little too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\美冬うつむき血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"I'm fine... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm fine..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>She doesn't look fine to me...<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you're getting on in years too, so old folks should act their age and get to bed early, you know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―is what I wanted to say, but of course I held my tongue.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd rather she just fell asleep, so I deliberately didn't keep the conversation going.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm the only one with any energy left.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Say, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wanted her to sleep, but it was <STYLE ID="1">Obasan</STYLE> who broke the silence.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"This is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">just something I've been imagining on my own, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Yeah."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Did that man really cut off </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> head, I wonder..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Huh?"</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Mmm..."</STYLE>
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> let out a sound as if answering <STYLE ID="1">Obasan</STYLE> and flopped onto the floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She rolled onto her back and began to breathe softly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan's</STYLE> sleeping face is very cute.<PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
With <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> asleep, <STYLE ID="1">Obasan</STYLE> showed a look of <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="あんど">relief</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see―the <STYLE ID="1">"that man"</STYLE> <STYLE ID="1">Obasan</STYLE> meant is <STYLE ID="11">Kotaro-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A very unpleasant story if <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> heard it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Obasan</STYLE> began to speak again, as if she'd made up her mind.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I started thinking something strange. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―if he wasn't the one who cut off </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> head... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="12">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> might be the one who did it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... that's </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Haruka's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Obasan</STYLE> gave a small nod.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I understand what she's saying, but not what she wants to say.<PG>
<STYLE ID="12">Ojisan</STYLE> cut off <STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san's</STYLE> head?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">Kotaro-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="12">Ojisan</STYLE> are identical twins, so a mistake is entirely possible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that's only if <STYLE ID="12">Ojisan</STYLE> were alive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the time, <STYLE ID="12">Ojisan</STYLE> had already been dead 2 years.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Obasan</STYLE> must understand that well enough.<PG>
So what <STYLE ID="1">Obasan</STYLE> wants to say is―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"You mean </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Ojisan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> ghost appeared?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Roughly speaking, I suppose that's what it comes to."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"A ghost's doing, at this point..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I think the idea of a ghost is terribly silly myself. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> cutting off </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> head is every bit as impossible."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
At that, I remembered the riverbank from before.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\沈丁花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "12" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">Kotaro-san</STYLE> still thinks of <STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san</STYLE> and faithfully visits her grave.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Deep as their love was, to cut off her head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's behavior that does make you wonder if he'd lost his mind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But losing your mind and a ghost are on different planes of impossible.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山廃屋中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\美冬うつむき血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "12" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, saying something so strange. Please forget it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My reply will be taken as rejecting <STYLE ID="1">Obasan's</STYLE> idea.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What would <STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE> say if she heard this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That it's unscientific and not worth considering?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"You see, I got the idea from some advice </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> gave."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An unexpected name to bring up.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> said she was advised: 'The curse-killings are where impossible things happen. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Investigate with the unthinkable in view, too.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That's what </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> told her."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Impossible things happen... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">A ghost, too, is normally impossible..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So I tried thinking about it. What if it was a ghost's doing? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And then, the beheading of </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"If </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> were the culprit, what would the motive be...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">The reason he'd appear, even as a ghost, to cut off a head."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, I can think of plenty. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">For instance... preparing to cause the curse-killings every year."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Then the curse-killer is </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... there's no way, is there, after all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, <STYLE ID="1">Obasan</STYLE> fell silent.<PG>
But... 
{PAUSE ""}
but, somehow.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Part of it fit oddly well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course, thinking it a ghost is far too wild.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if <STYLE ID="12">Ojisan's</STYLE> ghost were the culprit, the motive and everything so far start to come oddly into focus.<PG>
They come into focus, and yet... 
{PAUSE ""}
I don't quite know myself why that is.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's the reverse of 'something nags at me'―it nags at me because 'nothing nags at me.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why is it that 'nothing nags at me' about the theory of <STYLE ID="12">Ojisan's</STYLE> ghost as the culprit?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could I already, without knowing it, have information that backs up the ghost theory?<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, ghost or not, what if we think a bit more with </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> as the culprit?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Whether or not he's a ghost... what do you mean?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"For instance... you know, like, he wasn't actually dead."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's impossible too. When </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> died, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Ryoji-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> saw it happen, you know?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　The hospital confirmed his death, the police did an autopsy, the settlement held the funeral, and the burial..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"I see... if he was cremated, there's no way, right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, no, that's not it―in the Arata settlement, the custom of burial in the earth still survives."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"What? So </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> was buried just as he was?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's right... but still, for him to be alive... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\美冬横顔血.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Hm, wait a moment. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Now that you mention it..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "太古の暗い鳴動.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"In the Arata settlement, they call the dead shinigami. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">A shinigami comes back to this world on the anniversary of its death and tries to take the living away. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The Arata settlement's memorial service is a rite to drive the shinigami off."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Not to mourn the deceased, or anything like that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"The rite is an empty formality now, so everyone attends the service simply meaning to mourn. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But trace it to its roots, and that's how the Arata settlement treats the shinigami."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\軍団.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What's more, every attendant has to wear a Noh mask and red robes, disguised so no one can tell who is who."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"That's what I saw in the forest just now!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　The people of the settlement were wearing Noh masks and red robes and carrying nata and maces!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's the formal dress for battle. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">When the residents of Arata fight a threat from outside, they've dressed that way since ancient times."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"To hide who they are, after all?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes. Even the people of Arata can't live on the settlement's supplies alone, so it's to keep from being recognized when they go out into the outside world."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Is that all it is, I wonder..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山廃屋中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\美冬血.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"I understand why they'd dress so the people outside can't recognize them when they fight... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">But is that really the only reason, I wonder."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What do you mean?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Then there'd be no reason to dress that way for the memorial service too, would there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So the shinigami can't tell the living apart―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Does the shinigami choose people?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Does it choose who it wants to take?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Not just anyone?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I can't tell that much, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I feel like something's missing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Noh masks and red robes so no individual can be identified... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">I understand that being identified is a problem when they go to the outside world. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">But against a shinigami it's meaningless―or rather, strange... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Then anyone who might be taken could just skip the memorial service, couldn't they? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Worst case, leave the settlement, or something."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"You mean there's a reason they have to attend the service even though a shinigami might take them?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Is that... what it is...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Am I overthinking it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's a tradition from ancient times, so it's only natural that empty formality, ritual, and unclear meaning seep through.<PG>
But... what is it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A reason to attend the service even though a shinigami might take you―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
I've seen a situation like that somewhere...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's dangerous, but you have to go.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Knowing the danger, you go, hiding who you are...<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Could that be... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Could it be... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">me, right now...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Suddenly, it came to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The one who came here knowing the danger, hiding who she is, is me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In my case, I came to the Arata settlement hiding my intuition from everyone but the Niimura family.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because in the Arata settlement, precognition is shunned as 'a witch's power.'<PG>
No, wait, surely that's not all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The reverse is possible too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is also <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="つな">tied</STYLE> to precognition, but―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜散る.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The other thing that comes to mind is the conditions for my precognition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In my case, precognition works when the wind hits me where there are cherry trees, but there's one more condition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to directly see, or hear the voice of, the person who will be in danger.<PG>
If I can't identify the person, I can't sense it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="14">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> works through my eyes and ears, so―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
and a way to prevent that would be...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words... 
{PAUSE ""}
Could it be... 
{PAUSE ""}
the means to stand against <STYLE ID="14">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> is―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
